From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: a swap chain's frame is not covered by the old window surface when a window goes to direct drawing

The first SetWindowPos after a window got a Vulkan (or OpenGL) client window
switches it from its window surface to drawing straight to its X window
(X11DRV_CreateWindowSurface: direct drawing once a client window exists).
apply_window_pos then copied the old surface's bits over the client area
(move_window_bits_surface, through a window DC with IncludeInferiors) -- over
the swap chain's X window too -- and the frame was hidden until the program
presented again, which a still page never does. Windows keeps a swap chain's
last frame over GDI. The copy is now skipped when the new surface is direct
drawing and the window has a client surface.
---
diff --git a/dlls/win32u/window.c b/dlls/win32u/window.c
index 326c729..4a8af77 100644
--- a/dlls/win32u/window.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/window.c
@@ -2399,7 +2399,17 @@ static BOOL apply_window_pos( HWND hwnd, HWND insert_after, UINT swp_flags, stru
                 RECT rects[2] = {valid_rects[0], valid_rects[1]};
                 valid_rects = rects;
 
+                /* Stained Glass OS: going from a window surface to drawing straight to the X
+                 * window (new_surface NULL: the window has a Vulkan or OpenGL client window), the
+                 * old surface's GDI bits are not copied over the client area -- they went over
+                 * the swap chain's frame too, and hid it until the program presented again.
+                 * Windows keeps a swap chain's last frame over GDI. Viber's elevated copy, raised
+                 * by a second copy, turned blank. */
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_COPY_OVER_CLIENT_SURFACE
                 if (old_surface != new_surface)
+#else
+                if (old_surface != new_surface && (new_surface || !window_has_client_surface( hwnd )))
+#endif
                     move_window_bits_surface( hwnd, &new_rects->window, old_surface, &old_rects.visible, valid_rects );
                 else
                 {
